grown green bush on the left is trimmed back.\n\nPhase 2 (Steel Pergola & Deck Building): Workers weld and erect a black steel frame pergola overhead on the left, adding translucent roof panels and installing a side wire mesh grid. Simultaneously, carpenters rebuild the wooden deck into dark charcoal tiered steps, embedding warm LED strip lighting underneath each step edge.\n\nPhase 3 (Outdoor Kitchen & Paving): On the right side of the deck, workers construct a concrete/corten-metal outdoor kitchen counter, fitting a stainless steel gas grill and stacking cut firewood into the bottom open compartment. On the lower ground, workers reset large stone slabs and pour light grey gravel into the stone gaps, while erecting a dark wood slatted privacy screen behind the sofa area.\n\nPhase 4 (Furnishing & Lighting): Workers place a dark grey L-shaped outdoor sectional sofa beneath the newly built black pergola, with a round wooden spool coffee table in front of it and a tall patio heater next to the kitchen. \n\nAs daylight seamlessly shifts to twilight dusk, all construction tools are cleared away. The embedded LED step strip lights, overhead ceiling spotlights, and wall lamps illuminate warmly. Physical assembly throughout, hyper-realistic, 8k resolution timelapse, zero screen-fading."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":281,"type":"ResizeImageMaskNode","pos":[1160,3960],"size":[260,160],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"input","name":"input","type":"IMAGE,MASK","link":480},{"localized_name":"resize_type","name":"resize_type","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"resize_type"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"width","name":"resize_type.width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"resize_type.width"},"link":430},{"localized_name":"height","name":"resize_type.height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"resize_type.height"},"link":431},{"localized_name":"crop","name":"resize_type.crop","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"resize_type.crop"},"link":null